7)CLIPBOARD MANAGEMENT

Create a variable [clipboardText] with datatype String
Invoke code(activity)
 Code
clipboardText  =  System.Windows.Clipboard.GetText()

Arguments
 Key = out_clipboardText
Type = String
Direction = out
Value = clipboardText

MessageBox(activity)
 “Clipboard value:” +clipboardText
In notepad ,Type some text and copy that value because the copied text is viewed in message box as output
